---
manual: app.style.resizable
lines: [869, 878]
testability: interactive
display: any
----------- app code
Shoes.app(title: "White Circle",
  width: 200, height: 200, resizable: false) {
    background black
    button("Spawn") { window { para "I can be resized" } }
}
----------- test code
find_button("Spawn").trigger_click

main, spawned = Shoes.APPS
assert_equal false, main.style[:resizable], "resizable: false reaches the app"
assert_equal true, spawned.style[:resizable], "windows are resizable unless told otherwise"
